%% The consent sequence a connector must follow.
%% Specified in openspec/specs/capability-system.md; no connector is shipped in
%% this version, so nothing implements this flow yet.
sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Privacy as Privacy view
  participant Registry as Capability registry
  participant Module as Connector module
  participant Provider as External provider

  User->>Privacy: Ask to enable a connector
  Privacy->>Registry: Read manifest
  Registry-->>Privacy: Provider, purpose, scopes, data flow
  Privacy-->>User: Show all four before anything loads
  User->>Privacy: Explicit consent
  Privacy->>Registry: Record consent locally
  Registry->>Module: Dynamic import (first time any code loads)
  Module->>Provider: Authorization Code with PKCE, no client secret
  Provider-->>Module: Transient token, never persisted
  User->>Privacy: Withdraw consent
  Privacy->>Module: Discard token and disable
